data: {"id": "955f5adf69434f55-thinking-parallel_evidence-824", "run_id": "955f5adf69434f55", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的证据，我来总结当前事实：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 当前状态：**\n- `workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` 状态为 **Pending**，STATUS = `CreateContainerConfigError`，重启次数 = 0\n- 原因明确：**`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`**\n\n**证据一致性：**\n1. `kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_get_yaml` 均显示相同错误信息——容器无法启动，因为引用了 Secret `workload-input` 中不存在的 key `unavailable-key`\n2. `kubectl_events` 显示该错误持续 33 分钟，累计发生 12 次（x12 over 33m），说明 Pod 一直卡在同一个错误上未恢复\n3. `kubectl_get_by_name` 确认状态未变（`CreateContainerConfigError`, 0/1 R", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789053922918, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

